  "change_claim": {
    "affected_components": [],
    "architecture_delta": "New xtask modules corpus::{fixture, grade, runner}; the checker's findings carry structured fields (CHG-004.1); the docs command projects the latest H4 record into docs/enforcement-map.md. No new dependency.",
    "contract_changes": "none: no product component exists",
    "intent": "Generate declared crate-level fixtures; run and strictly grade the checker and separate compiler case; retain H4 evidence and generate the enforcement map.",
    "non_goals": [
      "Module harness (CHG-007)",
      "Transitive evaluator",
      "Reading or running Kennedy's held-out cases (DP-1.1b)",
      "Changing Accepted maturity (DP-1.6)",
      "Changing manifest expectations or grading"
    ],
    "performance_impact": "none claimed",
    "source": {
      "path": ".rha/tasks/CHG-004-h4-crate-harness.toml",
      "sha256": "61de938243cd8da8052f9ead000fd43aea107a6e872435677611cdb55871e4e8"
    },
    "task": "CHG-004",
    "unresolved": [
      "C13: the checker's accurate adapter.foreign_core warning about adapter-x -> core-b is an unmatched finding under DP-1.1c, so the H4 run is failed and law3-d1 is downgraded. Kennedy decides between amending the registration and leaving the result failed (change record, acceptance concern 1).",
      "Pedantic Clippy warnings in xtask/src/corpus/ (naming, formatting, function length). L0.clippy passes under the §6.4 policy, which denies clippy::all and warns pedantic; a tidy-up is a later sub-item with no grading or execution consequence. (Moved here from the removed docs/backlog.md.)",
      "The docs projection does not reject a stale H4 manifest digest; the current record matches the protected manifest. A guard belongs with the re-registration mechanics of CHG-007 or the record lint of CHG-019. (Moved here from the removed docs/backlog.md.)",
      "Four records cite revisions absent from this branch's history, because the draft was rewritten before its first push: evidence/CHG-004/20260920T115809Z-762ab470f54b.json, evidence/CHG-004/20260920T120146Z-540ce6a70c43.json, evidence/h4-crate/20260920T115738Z-defbfb7196a6-1446859.json, evidence/h4-crate/20260920T120111Z-b8c37856c21a-1452921.json. Kept as observations; their subjects cannot be checked out and they are not the evidence for this candidate.",
      "xtask/tests/corpus_crate.rs pins C13 as the one failed case; a registration amendment changes that assertion in the same commit.",
      "Held-out cases: not run by any agent; Kennedy runs them at acceptance (DP-1.1b)."
    ]
  },
